usage: run-probes.py [-h] --binding BINDING --api {21,35} --output OUTPUT
                     [--adb ADB]

Explicit #2187 class-only sequence; no device action on import or --help.
Requires Root's frozen binding and exclusive device lease. Never selects
Trime, launches its Application/activity/service, writes its prefs, or re-
signs an APK. Each diagnostic is a namespace copy, not the producer's
application APK.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --binding BINDING
  --api {21,35}
  --output OUTPUT
  --adb ADB
